  "plugins": [
    {
      "name": "dsh-theme-studio",
      "title": {
        "en": "Theme studio",
        "zh": "主题工坊"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Puts a wallpaper behind the Web GUI, shows a custom title and icon above the conversation, and tints the sidebar logo. Open the panel from the palette entry in the left sidebar, or click the custom title; there you can upload a picture or paste an image address, set how much of it shows through the interface, set the header title and icon (an emoji, a short text, or an uploaded image), and pick a colour for the DeepSeek Harness mark at the top left. Changes apply immediately, are stored in this browser only, and the panel's Reset button clears them; removing the plugin restores the default look.",
        "zh": "给 DSH 界面铺一张壁纸，在对话区上方显示自定义标题与图标，并给侧栏图标换个颜色。从左栏的调色板入口打开面板，或直接点击自定义标题；面板里可以上传图片或填写图片地址、调整壁纸的可见度、设置标题和图标（emoji、短文字或上传的小图标），并为左上角的 DeepSeek Harness 图标挑选颜色。修改即时生效，仅保存在当前浏览器；面板上的「恢复默认」会清空设置，卸载插件后界面恢复原样。"
      },
